      {
        "author_name": "Elizabeth Martel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107439712357729016717/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZybC6nPnanDUVMAd3oHEQuocKPMkmWP4LB10nd1MadzItT7TK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "They have very good sales here, you can get an item that's regular price 60$ for 5$, I went here for flip flops for my spa outings and I got 3 pairs each for 8$, can't get better price than that anywhere and they are not too bad in quality. My hubby got a 60$ sleevless puffer vest for 10$, can't beat that!. Very happy with my winnings.",
        "time": 1742680450,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kate Holloway",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105842304843608518303/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJuNlGzSghlWp-wFgxG_FRnGly3IEOJsST_rD9n9hLyTozjng=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Shopped this location on 25/07/2025, and it was a great experience.  Store was clean, well stocked, organized, and the Staff were friendly.  There were a lot of sales and the prices were great.  With these great prices, we bought more items than we planned!  Old Navy is great for those casual and playful items at an affordable price, and this location did not disappoint.",
        "time": 1753548480,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Fat and Funny",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106618479454385453841/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoV9hrX6TydGSdAWrmyGV8NZoGaLAFGYwoqr8vL2v_FuJo0CRb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Great outlet shopping in the West Island! This store is well stocked with a great selection of clothing for the season. You’ll find a variety of sizes and clothing types. Great service and a clean environment. One of my favourite places for shopping.",
        "time": 1606091528,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carol Ann King",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108007014926061656872/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ4Fcrc4iV7nR_csd45m9sugVPWJcAjiTxfebSGPt94xceqAw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I had a few returns to do on a busy Sunday afternoon , I must say, the girl that took care of my confusing return bags was friendly, patient, and kind.\nI have to say that this is always the case at this Old Navy outlet.\nCustomer service is always outstanding! Thank you!",
        "time": 1763942159,
        "translated": false
